title: A Friend on the Executive
subtitle: Not everyone in Moscow agrees with the directive.
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and directive_active = 1 and sys_appeal_timer <= 0 and ecci_friend_favour >= 60 and ecci_friend_is_author = 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.sys_appeal_timer = 4;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.sys_outcome = 0;
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: international

= A Friend on the Executive

A private letter has come from Moscow, from **[+ ecci_friend_name +]**. He does not say so in as many words, but he thinks [+ directive_from_name +]'s directive on *[+ directive_title +]* is a mistake, and he is willing to say so in the Executive, for a price he does not need to name.

- @withdraw: Ask him to have the directive withdrawn.
- @soften: Ask him to have it softened.
- @easy_discard

@withdraw
subtitle: It may work. Either way, we will owe him, and [+ directive_from_name +] will know.
on-arrival: {!
var p = 0.45 + (Q.ecci_friend_favour - 60) / 80;
RG.ecci(Q.directive_from, -6);
if (Math.random() < p) {
    Q.sys_outcome = 1;
    RG.ecci(Q.ecci_friend, -12);
    RG.directiveResolve('withdrawn');
    RG.news('The Executive withdraws its directive to the German section');
} else {
    Q.sys_outcome = 2;
    RG.ecci(Q.ecci_friend, -5);
}
!}

[? if sys_outcome = 1 : [+ ecci_friend_name +] raises the matter at the Executive, and wins. The directive is withdrawn "in view of the special conditions in Germany". ?][? if sys_outcome = 2 : [+ ecci_friend_name +] raises the matter and is outvoted. The directive stands. ?]

@soften
subtitle: The directive becomes easier to satisfy. He spends a little of his goodwill.
on-arrival: {!
RG.ecci(Q.ecci_friend, -5);
RG.comply(20);
!}

The Executive issues a "clarification". Read carefully, it asks for rather less than the directive did.
